{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"cmd":"install_lib","ctl":"dev","desc":"The peer-to-peer install path: streams the library zip from the given peer over the encrypted peer channel, verifies its hash, installs data/<lib>, brings runtime/<app> in line through dev.dev.refresh_apps (shipped files replaced, app.properties included; botd.properties kept; a new app copied in inactive; apps= never written; a symlinked runtime/<app> is written through the link), then runs dev.dev.activate_lib - so FFI libraries hot-load. When data/<lib> is a symlink (a library installed from a git checkout) the zip is written THROUGH the link: the link survives, the checkout is left dirty with the pushed version and marked as a peer overlay (dev.git.overlay), which the sweepers never commit and dev.github.update / dev.git.update_from_master restore to git (the runtime files written through a link into that checkout included). A second push replaces a standing overlay; a push onto a checkout that holds this box's own uncommitted edits to the library is refused (panic). Returns true when the instance needs ONE restart to finish activating (surface that to the user); false when the install is live immediately.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse crate::peer::service::exec::exec;\nuse crate::peer::service::listen::get_best;\nuse std::env::temp_dir;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse std::fs::File;\nuse std::io::Write;\nuse std::thread;\nuse core::time::Duration;\nuse crate::app::util::hash::hash;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::file::copy_dir::copy_dir;\nuse std::fs::remove_dir_all;\nuse std::fs;\nuse std::fs::create_dir_all;\nuse std::fs::remove_file;\nuse crate::security::security::init::get_user;\nuse flowlang::appserver::init_globals;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::system_call::system_call;\nuse crate::dev::dev::activate_lib::activate_lib;\n","lib":"dev","params":[{"name":"uuid","type":"String"},{"name":"lib","type":"String"}],"returntype":"Boolean","type":"rust"},"id":"kqgjmx1840a9081cdh172","readers":[],"time":1795225047544,"username":"system","writers":[]}